      "seed": 282499861,
      "version": 516,
      "versionNonce": 1617984671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190057324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "l2n8vT4WwggLpJwRrAbfA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1.2978212045898374,
      "y": 810.9891031875,
      "width": 57.29997253417969,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1977380981,
      "version": 1282,
      "versionNonce": 932548799,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190057324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oChqqYfrqk0eTd21dnkJ_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -162.7138514140624,
      "y": 846.1286909129949,
      "width": 395.995361328125,
      "height": 90.75806964950536,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1514183125,
      "version": 1627,
      "versionNonce": 1833115871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190057324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Memory is 1D. \nRAM and GPU memory are one long list of addresses.\nThere is no \"row 2, col 3\" in hardware, only address #N.\nEvery 2D/3D array must be flattened somehow.\n",
      "fontSize": 14.521291143920864,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Memory is 1D. \nRAM and GPU memory are one long list of addresses.\nThere is no \"row 2, col 3\" in hardware, only address #N.\nEvery 2D/3D array must be flattened somehow.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R9hNWmwiI6If3aKOtwP4q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -176.81095697656258,
      "y": 931.3236399877476,
      "width": 395.995361328125,
      "height": 54.454841789703245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1729664821,
      "version": 1937,
      "versionNonce": 372712628,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791363284100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Allocating memory gives you one long strip.\nAsking for space for a W x H grid gives you\nW * H slots in a row.",
      "fontSize": 14.521291143920864,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Allocating memory gives you one long strip.\nAsking for space for a W x H grid gives you\nW * H slots in a row.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "np8SZBZW5lb6DCnIYI1xo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -169.48128347656245,
      "y": 1002.8329106051483,
      "width": 395.995361328125,
      "height": 72.60645571960433,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 113895573,
      "version": 2258,
      "versionNonce": 654755857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190159332,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. A formula turns (row, col) into a slot number.\nSome languages hide this step, but it always happens.\nOn the GPU you usally write it yourself:\n row * W + col or col * H + row",
      "fontSize": 14.521291143920864,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. A formula turns (row, col) into a slot number.\nSome languages hide this step, but it always happens.\nOn the GPU you usally write it yourself:\n row * W + col or col * H + row",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FlCpyDuEwGxFf7DbaHRFj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -172.7445395390625,
      "y": 1094.379587452698,
      "width": 395.995361328125,
      "height": 36.30322785980216,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 990514677,
      "version": 2448,
      "versionNonce": 416528703,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190057324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Row-major vs column-major is just the choice of\nwhich direction gets flattened first.",
      "fontSize": 14.521291143920864,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Row-major vs column-major is just the choice of\nwhich direction gets flattened first.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5KE3_dWzzYWbGB0gRb0ud",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -139.77140648437492,
      "y": 743.0116164306103,
      "width": 373.51904296875,
      "height": 16.655023138779125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1465910101,
      "version": 2741,
      "versionNonce": 1168652639,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190057324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule: neighboring threads should read neighboring memory.",
      "fontSize": 13.324018511023299,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rule: neighboring threads should read neighboring memory.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jbvQO4HobEn5KvYfFiSl6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -175.43313066406242,
      "y": 1152.4868460700986,
      "width": 395.995361328125,
      "height": 36.30322785980216,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 303450075,
      "version": 2587,
      "versionNonce": 1077392767,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791190057324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Neither is faster. Speed comes from reading\nin the same direction as data is stored.",
      "fontSize": 14.521291143920864,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Neither is faster. Speed comes from reading\nin the same direction as data is stored.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
